    caption: "答え　36/25cm（1.44cm）",
    slides: [
      {"note":"直線ℓと2つの円A（半径9）、B（半径4）に同時に接する、すき間の小さな円Cの半径を求める。","add":[{"t":"box","x":0,"y":0,"w":320,"h":240,"color":"#FFFFFF","fill":"#FFFFFF","size":14},{"t":"line","x1":20,"y1":140,"x2":300,"y2":140,"color":"#6E645C"},{"t":"circle","cx":60,"cy":104,"r":36,"color":"#0284C7","text":"A","size":12},{"t":"circle","cx":108,"cy":124,"r":16,"color":"#16A34A","text":"B","size":12},{"t":"circle","cx":88.8,"cy":134.2,"r":5.76,"color":"#9333EA","fill":"#F3E8FF"},{"t":"box","x":20,"y":166,"w":280,"h":30,"text":"半径9の円A・半径4の円B","color":"#6E645C","fill":"#FFF8EC","size":14},{"t":"box","x":20,"y":202,"w":280,"h":30,"text":"ℓと2円に接する円Cの半径は？","color":"#0284C7","fill":"#E0F2FE","size":14}]},
      {"note":"3つの円に直接の式を立てるのは難しい。そこで「ℓに接する2円がたがいに外接する」ときの、接点どうしの横の長さ d を調べる。中心を結ぶ線は r₁＋r₂、中心の高さの差は r₁−r₂ なので、三平方の定理で d²＝(r₁＋r₂)²−(r₁−r₂)²＝4r₁r₂、つまり d＝2√(r₁r₂)。この式を円A・C、円C・B、円A・B の3組に使う。","add":[{"t":"box","x":0,"y":0,"w":320,"h":240,"color":"#FFFFFF","fill":"#FFFFFF","size":14},{"t":"line","x1":20,"y1":140,"x2":300,"y2":140,"color":"#6E645C"},{"t":"circle","cx":60,"cy":104,"r":36,"color":"#0284C7"},{"t":"circle","cx":108,"cy":124,"r":16,"color":"#16A34A"},{"t":"line","x1":60,"y1":104,"x2":108,"y2":124,"color":"#6E645C","dashed":true},{"t":"line","x1":60,"y1":104,"x2":60,"y2":124,"color":"#6E645C","dashed":true},{"t":"line","x1":60,"y1":124,"x2":108,"y2":124,"color":"#6E645C","dashed":true},{"t":"label","x":84,"y":153,"text":"d","size":11,"color":"#E11D48","anchor":"middle"},{"t":"box","x":20,"y":166,"w":280,"h":30,"text":"接点どうしの横の長さ d","color":"#6E645C","fill":"#FFF8EC","size":14},{"t":"box","x":20,"y":202,"w":280,"h":30,"text":"d²＝(r₁+r₂)²−(r₁−r₂)²＝4r₁r₂","color":"#0284C7","fill":"#E0F2FE","size":13}]},
      {"note":"円AとBの接点どうしの横の長さは d＝2√(9×4)＝2×6＝12。円Cは AとBの間にあるので、AとCの横の長さと、CとBの横の長さをたすと12になる。","add":[{"t":"box","x":0,"y":0,"w":320,"h":240,"color":"#FFFFFF","fill":"#FFFFFF","size":14},{"t":"box","x":20,"y":87,"w":280,"h":30,"text":"A,B：d＝2√(9×4)＝12","color":"#6E645C","fill":"#FFF8EC","size":14},{"t":"box","x":20,"y":123,"w":280,"h":30,"text":"Cは間にあるので 横の長さの和が12","color":"#6E645C","fill":"#FFF8EC","size":14}]},
      {"note":"Cの半径を r とする。A−C の横の長さは 2√(9r)＝6√r。C−B の横の長さは 2√(4r)＝4√r。たすと 12 になるので 6√r＋4√r＝12。","add":[{"t":"box","x":0,"y":0,"w":320,"h":240,"color":"#FFFFFF","fill":"#FFFFFF","size":14},{"t":"box","x":20,"y":69,"w":280,"h":30,"text":"A−C：2√(9r)＝6√r","color":"#6E645C","fill":"#FFF8EC","size":14},{"t":"box","x":20,"y":105,"w":280,"h":30,"text":"C−B：2√(4r)＝4√r","color":"#6E645C","fill":"#FFF8EC","size":14},{"t":"box","x":20,"y":141,"w":280,"h":30,"text":"6√r＋4√r＝12","color":"#0284C7","fill":"#E0F2FE","size":14}]},
      {"note":"10√r＝12 より √r＝6/5。2乗して r＝36/25（＝1.44）。","add":[{"t":"box","x":0,"y":0,"w":320,"h":240,"color":"#FFFFFF","fill":"#FFFFFF","size":14},{"t":"box","x":20,"y":87,"w":280,"h":30,"text":"10√r＝12 → √r＝6/5","color":"#6E645C","fill":"#FFF8EC","size":14},{"t":"box","x":20,"y":123,"w":280,"h":30,"text":"r＝36/25","color":"#0284C7","fill":"#E0F2FE","size":14}]},
      {"note":"36/25cm（1.44cm）。","add":[{"t":"box","x":0,"y":0,"w":320,"h":240,"color":"#FFFFFF","fill":"#FFFFFF","size":14},{"t":"box","x":20,"y":105,"w":280,"h":30,"text":"答え　36/25cm（1.44cm）","color":"#16A34A","fill":"#DCFCE7","size":14}]},
      {"note":"確かめ：√r＝1.2 なので、6√r＝7.2、4√r＝4.8。たすと 7.2＋4.8＝12 で、AとBの横の長さ12に一致する。半径1.44cmはBの半径4cmより小さく、すき間に入る大きさとして自然。","add":[{"t":"box","x":0,"y":0,"w":320,"h":240,"color":"#FFFFFF","fill":"#FFFFFF","size":14},{"t":"box","x":20,"y":69,"w":280,"h":30,"text":"6√r＝6×1.2＝7.2","color":"#6E645C","fill":"#FFF8EC","size":14},{"t":"box","x":20,"y":105,"w":280,"h":30,"text":"4√r＝4×1.2＝4.8","color":"#6E645C","fill":"#FFF8EC","size":14},{"t":"box","x":20,"y":141,"w":280,"h":30,"text":"7.2＋4.8＝12 ✓","color":"#0284C7","fill":"#E0F2FE","size":14}]},
      {"note":"よくあるまちがい：接点どうしの横の長さを、半径の和 9＋4＝13 と思ってしまうミス。13 は中心どうしの距離で、横の長さ12とは別。また、6√r＋4√r を 10r と書いて √ を落とすミスもある。","add":[{"t":"box","x":0,"y":0,"w":320,"h":240,"color":"#FFFFFF","fill":"#FFFFFF","size":14},{"t":"box","x":20,"y":87,"w":280,"h":30,"text":"横の長さを 9＋4＝13 とする","color":"#E11D48","fill":"#FFE4E6","size":14},{"t":"box","x":20,"y":123,"w":280,"h":30,"text":"横の長さ d は 2√(r₁r₂)","color":"#E11D48","fill":"#FFE4E6","size":14}]},
    ],
